{"availability":"available","full":"duwqijlk/margin-words","name":"margin-words","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":13,"forks":3,"created":"2026-10-04T07:31:20Z","updated":"2026-10-07T12:18:30Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://inputread.site/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.953Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.953Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.953Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.953Z","stars":13,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A reader for English novels, made for Chinese junior-high learners. Tap a word and see a short English meaning written for that book. The buttons and menus are in Simplified Chinese or English. The books stay in English. There is no AI.","Margin Words is a reader for English novels. It is made for Chinese junior-high students who are starting to read real books in English.","Tap a word in the story. A card shows a short meaning in simple English, written for that book. Notes for a paragraph, a sentence, or a phrase stay beside the text, and the page does not jump when a card opens. The buttons and menus are in Simplified Chinese or English. The novels stay in English. The reader has no AI."],"features":["Notes beside the paragraph. A paragraph with a note keeps a small light beside it. Sentence notes and phrases open from the text in the same way.","A shelf, then Discover. A new shelf is empty and points to Discover. Discover is the only place to add a book, and adding needs a signed-in account. A signed-out visitor can still browse every title. Books already…","Public-domain classics. Alice, Treasure Island, and the other free books download when you add them. Speeches sit on their own tab.","Copyrighted books stay with the reader. For those titles, Discover offers a word list and an ISBN, not the novel. You add your own EPUB of that book. The app shows how well the file matches, and it warns you when the…","A notebook. Save a word and review it later. Each word is one card, with the sentence it came from."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"84d889795dd3c72479798455bcc717fd1acac9ff0e963522944bff7bb7cdb930","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:07.109Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:07.109Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A reader for English novels, made for Chinese junior-high learners. Tap a word and see a short English meaning written for that book. The buttons and menus are in Simplified Chinese or English. The books stay in English. There is no AI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A reader for English novels, made for Chinese junior-high learners. Tap a word and see a short English meaning written for that book. The buttons and menus are in Simplified Chinese or English. The books stay in English. There is no AI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md"},{"text":"Margin Words is a reader for English novels. It is made for Chinese junior-high students who are starting to read real books in English.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"A book already on the device can be read with no account and, after the first download, with no network.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"New books are added only from Discover, and that step needs a sign-in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"84d889795dd3c72479798455bcc717fd1acac9ff0e963522944bff7bb7cdb930","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/duwqijlk/margin-words/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:07.110